%% WYVERN-E — MOTOR-ejection recovery via bypass tube (no CO2, no pyro bay, no FC actuation)
%% Regenerated 2026-08 against we4_flightsim.py + we4_ejection_feasibility.py.
flowchart TD
    B[Burnout t=3.45 s] --> C[Coast; TVC neutral; FC logs only]
    C --> A[Apogee 6.82 s / 130.8 m / 429 ft]
    A --> E[F15-4 ejection charge fires t=7.45 s, +0.63 s past apogee, 6.1 m/s]
    E --> TU[Gas -> solid-walled bypass tube -> PAST sealed FC bay]
    TU --> P[Recovery bay pressurizes ~140 kPa vs 14-41 kPa release]
    P --> N[Friction-fit nose releases -> 18 in chute + Nomex -> 6.2 m/s descent]
